\newlabel{fig:overlap_figures}{{9}{7}{N-gram overlap analysis of deduplication-removed vs.\ retained documents. Left: Mean overlap rates per benchmark. Center: Distribution of overlap scores. Right: Spearman rank correlation ($\rho = 1.0$) between predicted and observed contamination ranking. Full experiment ($n=10{,}000$) pending}{figure.9}{}}
